{
  "info": {
    "name": "ms-auth T5 — OAuth 2.0 + RBAC",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el Tratamiento T5 del experimento de tesis.\n\n**Flujo de uso:**\n1. Ejecutar cualquier request de la carpeta '1. Obtener Token' para obtener un access_token.\n2. Copiar el access_token en la variable de colección `ACCESS_TOKEN`.\n3. Ejecutar los requests de '2. Validate — Casos Felices' y '3. Validate — Ataques'.\n\n**Puerto:** 3105\n**Mecanismo:** OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials Grant (RFC 6749 §4.4)\n**Autorización:** RBAC puro — BOLA activo (API1:2023)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "BASE_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:3105",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ACCESS_TOKEN",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Pegar aquí el access_token obtenido de POST /auth/token",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Obtener Token (POST /auth/token)",
      "description": "OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials Grant.\nObtiene un Access Token opaco (64 chars hex, TTL 15 min).\nGuarda automáticamente el token en la variable ACCESS_TOKEN.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token — admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ACCESS_TOKEN', body.access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('access_token presente', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.have.length(64));",
                  "    pm.test('token_type = Bearer', () => pm.expect(body.token_type).to.eql('Bearer'));",
                  "    pm.test('expires_in = 900', () => pm.expect(body.expires_in).to.eql(900));",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado:', body.access_token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"admin\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"tesis-admin-key-2026\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/token", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["auth", "token"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token — seller01",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
